Generic single-database configuration.

Set DATABASE_URL in .env to a MySQL 8 connection using the PyMySQL driver and
utf8mb4, then run:

    python -m alembic upgrade head

The migration chain creates the 13 normalized application tables, then adds a
learning_resources table (14 total) and seeds starter career categories, roles,
required skills, skill definitions, and free learning links. The migration
preserves existing user/profile/CV data and does not create an Admin account.
See the repository README for the secure Admin bootstrap command.